        <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 mb-4">
            This page was loaded from a <strong>lazy-loaded Razor Class Library (RCL)</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="bg-green-50 dark:bg-green-900/20 border border-green-200 dark:border-green-800 rounded-lg p-4 mb-4">
            <p class="text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 font-semibold">
                Lazy assembly loading with AdditionalAssemblies is working correctly!
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800 rounded-lg p-4">
